   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "OPEN PERIOD \u2014 a rental has no fixed length.\nDays are the difference between the dates on\nthe order; the item record carries no period.\nLate fee applies per day past the agreed return.",
