   "updated": 1789469969945,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "seed": 1085068645,
   "text": "Landed cost (ADR-009): header other_cost USD 300 is allocated PRO-RATA BY LINE VALUE.\n   allocated_i = 300.00 \u00d7 (line_value_i / \u03a3 line_value)\n   landed_unit_cost = unit_cost + (allocated + line_other) / qty_received\nOnly landed_unit_cost reaches inventory \u2014 never the raw unit cost.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Landed cost (ADR-009): header other_cost USD 300 is allocated PRO-RATA BY LINE VALUE.\n   allocated_i = 300.00 \u00d7 (line_value_i / \u03a3 line_value)\n   landed_unit_cost = unit_cost + (allocated + line_other) / qty_received\nOnly landed_unit_cost reaches inventory \u2014 never the raw unit cost.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "spec": true
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "JB1HYVh0dRZ2woOvi3uk",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1584.0000000000002,
   "y": 4858,
   "width": 383.68,
   "height": 88,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#d97706",
