   "text": "Send  \u2192 inventory_stock_transactions type=transfer_out (negative) at the\nSOURCE warehouse's weighted-average cost.\nReceive \u2192 type=transfer_in (positive) at that SAME unit cost.\nPartial receipt is supported via inventory_transfer_items.received_quantity;\nthe receiving branch confirms from its own Transfers list.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Send  \u2192 inventory_stock_transactions type=transfer_out (negative) at the\nSOURCE warehouse's weighted-average cost.\nReceive \u2192 type=transfer_in (positive) at that SAME unit cost.\nPartial receipt is supported via inventory_transfer_items.received_quantity;\nthe receiving branch confirms from its own Transfers list.",
